  (text "I2S0 master: BCK GPIO14, WS GPIO25, DOUT GPIO27 (front DAC), DIN GPIO35 (PCM1808), MCLK GPIO0 (12.288 MHz for the ADC).\nI2S1 slave on the same BCK / WS pins: DOUT GPIO26 (rear DAC). GPIO4 = DAC mute (XSMT), pulled low. GPIO32 / 33 CAN, GPIO13 / 22 node straps (the module has no GPIO23). GPIO12 / 2 / 15 / 5 left open (boot straps)." (at 215 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1ff55b8f-4fdf-51bf-b73a-5bbf0d70c414"))
